# Format (whitespace-separated, one symbol per line):
#   <address> <name> <kind> <module> <conf> [; comment]
#   kind:   func | data:<type>      (types are C-like; structures live in symbols/types.h)
#   module: original source file if known (from assert strings or a reference project), else -
#   conf:   V = original Volition name confirmed by a reference project
#           O = name describes observed behaviour (decompiled/assembly/runtime)
#           I = inferred, needs confirmation
# Names are C identifiers; C++ scope uses __ (gr__set_clip for gr::set_clip).
# Keep sorted by address.

